# WS3-07. Sources: spec/01-lexical.md §2 (no identifier length limit) and
# spec/17-codegen.md §1 (one valid C99 unit; C99 5.2.4.1 requires only 63
# significant initial characters for internal identifiers and 31 for external ones,
# so a long name must not collide or be rejected by the m68k toolchains).
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: (41) ==> (42)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
42
--- contrast-output
43
